issue_context.body:
### Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.
I would like to filter different requests based on the session id.

### Describe the solution you'd like
Create a logging scope in session middleware with the session id.

### Additional context
Here's the alternative that could be done.
```csharp
app.UseSession();
app.Use(async (context, next) =>
{
    var logger = context.RequestServices.GetService<ILogger<SessionMiddleware>>();
    var sessionFeature = context.Features.Get<ISessionFeature>();
    using var scope = logger.BeginScope(new SessionLogScope(sessionFeature.Session.Id))
    await next();    
});
```

_closed before here https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/2400_

